// Waybar 配置：适配 niri（Wayland）+ 4K 2x 缩放 + CaskaydiaCove Nerd Font
// 网络悬浮窗使用 Python GTK（已获用户授权）

{
  "layer": "top",
  "position": "top",
  "height": 32,
  "spacing": 6,

  "modules-left": ["niri/workspaces"],
  "modules-center": ["niri/window"],
  "modules-right": ["cpu", "memory", "custom/vram", "network", "pulseaudio", "custom/brightness", "custom/display", "tray", "custom/clock", "clock"],

  "niri/workspaces": {
    "format": "{icon}",
    "format-icons": {
      "default": "",
      "empty": "",
      "active": "",
      "focused": "",
      "urgent": ""
    },
    "disable-click": false,
    "enable-bar-scroll": true
  },

  "niri/window": {
    "format": "{title}",
    "icon": true,
    "icon-size": 18,
    "separate-outputs": true,
    "show-empty": false,
    "rewrite": {
      "(.*) — Mozilla Firefox": "  $1",
      "(.*) - Mozilla Firefox": "  $1",
      "(.*) - Visual Studio Code": "  $1",
      "(.*) - kitty": "  $1"
    }
  },

  "cpu": {
    "format": "cpu {usage}%",
    "interval": 5
  },

  "memory": {
    "format": "ram {percentage}%",
    "interval": 5
  },

  "custom/vram": {
    "exec": "~/.config/waybar/scripts/vram.sh",
    "interval": 5,
    "format": "vram {}",
    "tooltip": false
  },

  "network": {
    "format-wifi": " {signalStrength}%",
    "format-ethernet": " {ifname}",
    "format-disconnected": " 断开",
    "tooltip-format-wifi": "已连接：{essid}\n信号强度：{signalStrength}%",
    "tooltip-format-ethernet": "有线连接：{ifname}",
    "tooltip-format-disconnected": "未连接网络",
    "interval": 5,
    "on-click": "/home/wjf/.config/waybar/scripts/network_popup.py"
  },

  "pulseaudio": {
    "format": " {volume}%",
    "format-muted": " 静音",
    "scroll-step": 5,
    "on-click": "wpctl set-mute @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@ toggle"
  },

  "custom/brightness": {
    "exec": "/home/wjf/.config/waybar/scripts/brightness.sh",
    "interval": 2,
    "signal": 8,
    "exec-on-event": true,
    "format": " {}",
    "tooltip": false,
    "on-scroll-up": "/home/wjf/.config/waybar/scripts/brightness.sh up",
    "on-scroll-down": "/home/wjf/.config/waybar/scripts/brightness.sh down"
  },

  "custom/display": {
    "format": "",
    "tooltip": true,
    "tooltip-format": "显示设置：分辨率 / 刷新率 / 缩放",
    "on-click": "/home/wjf/.config/waybar/scripts/display_settings_popup.py"
  },

  "tray": {
    "spacing": 8
  },

  "custom/clock": {
    "exec": "~/.config/waybar/scripts/clock.sh",
    "interval": 30,
    "return-type": "json",
    "justify": "center",
    "format": "{}"
  },

  "clock": {
    "format": "{:%H:%M}",
    "interval": 30,
    "tooltip-format": "{:%Y-%m-%d %A}"
  }
}
